Subject: [PATCH] Redesign landing page with sidebar nav + dashboard-style hero
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the top nav and simple live-demo mock with a dark sidebar
(Dashboard/Interviews/Analysis/AI insights/Practice/Reports/Settings)
and a dashboard-style hero panel: video call tile, AI interview score
gauge, score breakdown donut, practice recommendations, and AI
insights — matching the reference UI/UX, with placeholder avatars
instead of stock photos.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Fu2sSsp6bDbP9q2Ux1SHG6
